flowchart LR
  subgraph Reader
    RM[wait mutex] --> RI[increment read_count]
    RI --> RF{first reader?}
    RF -->|yes| RW[wait wrt]
    RF -->|no| RU[post mutex]
    RW --> RU --> READ[read/check/cache]
    READ --> RD[decrement under mutex]
    RD --> RL{last reader?}
    RL -->|yes| RP[post wrt]
  end
  subgraph Writer
    WW[wait wrt] --> WRITE[update a, b, sum]
    WRITE --> WP[post wrt]
  end
